# Code lookup

**Full module map:** `@.cursor/context/module-map.md` — grep and read only the files listed for your subsystem.

**Product behavior:** `@cursor/new/features.txt`

## Defaults

| Concern | Location |
|---------|----------|
| Command registration | `extension.js` |
| Session / KB state | `lib/state.js` (`DripState`) |
| Constants / view IDs | `lib/constants.js` |

## Do not

- Whole-repo scans
- Edit files not tied to the current task
- Assume architecture — read module map + spec section first

When spec and code differ, treat `features.txt` as target behavior and document the gap.

**Ergonomics:** If you add or move files, update `@.cursor/context/module-map.md` so the next developer finds the right module immediately. See `@.cursor/rules/core/developer-ergonomics.mdc`.
